<title>HUNGARY: GARDENIA TO START TRADE ON APRIL 14 ON BUDAPEST MKT.</title>
<headline>GARDENIA TO START TRADE ON APRIL 14 ON BUDAPEST MKT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange said on Thursday it had set April 14 as the first trading day in shares of curtain manufacturer Gardenia Rt.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
